const INTERESTS={street:"街区散步",shopping:"购物・古着",food:"吃吃喝喝",nature:"自然风景",sea:"海边",coffee:"咖啡店",art:"艺术设计",culture:"寺社・文化",hike:"轻徒步"};
const state={base:"tokyo",month:10,days:6,pace:"explore",scope:"all",interests:new Set(["street","shopping","nature"]),selected:new Set(),visited:new Set(),plan:[],locked:new Set()};
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s); const $$=s=>[...document.querySelectorAll(s)];
function activeData(){return DATA[state.base]}
function allPlaces(){return activeData().places}
function match(p){return p.tags.filter(t=>state.interests.has(t)).length}
function seasonMatch(p){return state.month>0&&(p.months.length===0||p.months.includes(state.month))}
function score(p){return match(p)*10+(seasonMatch(p)?3:0)+(state.pace==="easy"&&p.scope==="city"?1:state.pace==="explore"&&p.scope==="near"?1:0)}
function monthLabel(){return state.month?`${state.month} 月`:"时间未定"}
function filtered(){return allPlaces().filter(p=>(state.scope==="all"||p.scope===state.scope)&&(!$("#hide-visited").checked||!state.visited.has(p.id))).sort((a,b)=>score(b)-score(a))}
function showToast(msg){const t=$("#toast");t.textContent=msg;t.classList.add("visible");clearTimeout(showToast.timer);showToast.timer=setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove("visible"),2200)}
function setPressed(container,selector,value,key){container.querySelectorAll(selector).forEach(b=>b.setAttribute("aria-pressed",b.dataset[key]===value))}
function renderInterests(){const counts={};allPlaces().forEach(p=>p.tags.forEach(t=>counts[t]=(counts[t]||0)+1));const tags=Object.keys(counts).sort((a,b)=>counts[b]-counts[a]);$("#interests").innerHTML=tags.map(t=>`<button class="chip" data-interest="${t}" aria-pressed="${state.interests.has(t)}">${INTERESTS[t]}</button>`).join("");$$('[data-interest]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.interests.has(b.dataset.interest)?state.interests.delete(b.dataset.interest):state.interests.add(b.dataset.interest);renderInterests();renderCards()})}
function renderHero(){const d=activeData();const img=$("#city-image");img.src=d.image;img.alt=d.alt;img.style.objectPosition=state.base==="osaka"?"50% 62%":"50% 50%";$("#city-caption").textContent=d.caption;$("#city-headline").textContent=d.headline;$("#city-subline").textContent=d.subline;$("#city-tab").textContent=d.city;$("#near-tab").textContent=d.city}
function renderCards(){const rows=filtered();$("#result-count").textContent=`${rows.length} 个候选`;const interestText=state.interests.size?[...state.interests].map(t=>INTERESTS[t]).join("、"):"未限定兴趣";$("#ranking-note").textContent=`推荐排序考虑：${interestText} · ${monthLabel()} · ${state.pace==='easy'?'轻松节奏':'探索周边'}。活动范围只负责筛选，不改变兴趣偏好。`;
  $("#cards").innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(p=>{const selected=state.selected.has(p.id),m=match(p),seasonal=seasonMatch(p);return `<article class="card ${selected?'selected':''}"><div class="card-top"><span class="category ${p.scope}">${p.scope==='city'?activeData().city+'市内':activeData().city+'周边'}</span><button class="visited" data-visit="${p.id}" aria-pressed="${state.visited.has(p.id)}">${state.visited.has(p.id)?'✓ 去过':'标记去过'}</button></div><h3>${p.name}</h3><span class="roman">${p.roman}</span><p class="card-desc">${p.desc}</p><p class="match">${m?`兴趣匹配：${p.tags.filter(t=>state.interests.has(t)).map(t=>INTERESTS[t]).join(' · ')}`:'与当前兴趣无直接匹配'}</p><p class="season-match ${seasonal?'':'season-neutral'}">${state.month===0?`季节提示：${p.season}`:seasonal?`适合 ${monthLabel()}：${p.season}`:`${monthLabel()}不是突出季节：${p.season}`}</p><p class="tradeoff"><strong>取舍：</strong>${p.trade}</p><div class="card-foot"><button class="details-button" data-detail="${p.id}">查看依据 →</button><button class="add-button" data-add="${p.id}">${selected?'已加入 ✓':'加入路线 +'}</button></div></article>`}).join(""):`<div class="empty">当前筛选下没有目的地。可以显示去过的地方，或切换范围。</div>`;
  $$('[data-add]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>togglePlace(b.dataset.add));$$('[data-visit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.visited.has(b.dataset.visit)?state.visited.delete(b.dataset.visit):state.visited.add(b.dataset.visit);renderCards()});$$('[data-detail]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>openDetail(b.dataset.detail));
}
function togglePlace(id){if(state.selected.has(id)){state.selected.delete(id);state.plan=state.plan.map(x=>x===id?null:x);state.locked.delete(id)}else{state.selected.add(id);const open=state.plan.findIndex((x,i)=>!x&&i>0&&i<state.plan.length-1);if(open>-1)state.plan[open]=id;else showToast("已加入候选；行程暂无空白日")};renderCards();renderPlan()}
function resetPlan(){state.plan=Array(state.days).fill(null);state.plan[0]="arrival";if(state.days>1)state.plan[state.days-1]="departure";state.locked.clear();state.selected.clear();renderPlan();renderCards()}
function generatePlan(){const max=Math.max(0,state.days-2);let candidates=[...state.selected].map(id=>allPlaces().find(p=>p.id===id)).filter(Boolean);const rest=allPlaces().filter(p=>!state.selected.has(p.id)&&!state.visited.has(p.id)).sort((a,b)=>score(b)-score(a));candidates=[...candidates,...rest];const chosen=[];for(const p of candidates){if(chosen.length>=max)break;const nearCount=chosen.filter(x=>x.scope==='near').length;if(state.pace==='easy'&&p.scope==='near'&&nearCount>=1)continue;chosen.push(p)}
  const newPlan=Array(state.days).fill(null);newPlan[0]="arrival";newPlan[state.days-1]="departure";for(let i=1;i<state.days-1;i++){const current=state.plan[i];if(current&&state.locked.has(current))newPlan[i]=current}let ci=0;for(let i=1;i<state.days-1;i++){if(newPlan[i])continue;while(ci<chosen.length&&newPlan.includes(chosen[ci].id))ci++;if(chosen[ci])newPlan[i]=chosen[ci++].id}state.plan=newPlan;state.selected=new Set(newPlan.filter(x=>x&&!['arrival','departure'].includes(x)));renderCards();renderPlan();showToast("已按当前偏好安排")}
function renderPlan(){if(state.plan.length!==state.days){state.plan=Array(state.days).fill(null);state.plan[0]="arrival";state.plan[state.days-1]="departure"}const near=state.plan.map(findPlace).filter(p=>p?.scope==='near').length;$("#plan-summary").textContent=`${monthLabel()}，以${activeData().city}为住宿基地，安排 ${state.days} 天。`;$("#night-count").textContent=`${state.days-1} 晚`;$("#near-count").textContent=`周边 ${near} 天`;
  $("#itinerary").innerHTML=state.plan.map((id,i)=>{if(id==='arrival')return dayHtml(i,"抵达・安顿","入住后在酒店周边自由活动。",false);if(id==='departure')return dayHtml(i,"返程・补买","根据航班时间安排，不塞远途行程。",false);const p=findPlace(id);if(p)return dayHtml(i,p.name,`${p.scope==='near'?'当天往返':'市内移动'} · ${p.time}`,true,id);return dayHtml(i,"留白的一天","加入心动地点，或按偏好自动安排。",false)}).join("");
  $$('[data-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>togglePlace(b.dataset.remove));$$('[data-lock]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.locked.has(b.dataset.lock)?state.locked.delete(b.dataset.lock):state.locked.add(b.dataset.lock);renderPlan()});
}
function dayHtml(i,title,sub,editable,id=""){return `<li class="day"><span class="day-num">${i+1}</span><div class="day-content"><div class="day-title"><span class="${title==='留白的一天'?'day-placeholder':''}">${title}</span></div><small>${sub}</small>${editable?`<div class="day-tools"><button data-lock="${id}" class="${state.locked.has(id)?'locked':''}">${state.locked.has(id)?'已锁定':'锁定'}</button><button data-remove="${id}">移除</button></div>`:''}</div></li>`}
function findPlace(id){return Object.values(DATA).flatMap(d=>d.places).find(p=>p.id===id)}
function openDetail(id){const p=findPlace(id),dialog=$("#detail-dialog");$("#detail-content").innerHTML=`<span class="eyebrow">${p.scope==='city'?'CITY WALK':'DAY TRIP'}</span><h2>${p.name}</h2><p>${p.desc}</p><h3>为什么可能适合</h3><p>${p.tags.map(t=>INTERESTS[t]).join(' · ')}。${p.time}。</p><h3>季节提示</h3><p>${p.season}。具体花期、红叶和天气需要在出发前确认。</p><h3>需要接受的取舍</h3><p>${p.trade}</p><p><a href="${p.source}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看官方目的地资料 ↗</a></p>`;dialog.showModal()}
function switchBase(base){if(base===state.base)return;state.base=base;setPressed($("#base-control"),'button',base,'base');resetPlan();renderInterests();renderHero();renderCards();renderCredits()}
function save(){localStorage.setItem('tabi-plan-v1',JSON.stringify({base:state.base,month:state.month,days:state.days,pace:state.pace,interests:[...state.interests],selected:[...state.selected],visited:[...state.visited],plan:state.plan,locked:[...state.locked]}));$("#saved-label").textContent=`已保存 · ${new Date().toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})}`;showToast("行程已保存到此设备")}
function load(){const raw=localStorage.getItem('tabi-plan-v1');if(!raw)return showToast("还没有已保存的行程");try{const x=JSON.parse(raw);state.base=x.base;state.month=Number.isInteger(x.month)?x.month:0;state.days=x.days;state.pace=x.pace;state.interests=new Set(x.interests);state.selected=new Set(x.selected);state.visited=new Set(x.visited);state.plan=x.plan;state.locked=new Set(x.locked);$("#month").value=state.month;$("#days").value=state.days;$("#pace").value=state.pace;setPressed($("#base-control"),'button',state.base,'base');renderAll();$("#saved-label").textContent="已恢复本机保存的行程";showToast("已恢复") }catch{showToast("保存内容无法读取")}}
function exportText(){const lines=[`日本独旅 · ${monthLabel()} · ${activeData().city}基地 · ${state.days}天${state.days-1}晚`,...state.plan.map((id,i)=>{const p=findPlace(id);return `Day ${i+1}  ${id==='arrival'?'抵达・安顿':id==='departure'?'返程・补买':p?p.name:'自由安排'}`}),`\n由 TABI 交互原型生成；请按实际日期确认交通、花期、天气与营业信息。`];const text=lines.join('\n');navigator.clipboard?.writeText(text).then(()=>showToast("文字行程已复制"),()=>downloadText(text))||downloadText(text)}
function downloadText(text){const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'}));a.download='TABI-日本独旅行程.txt';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href)}
function renderCredits(){$("#photo-credits").innerHTML=`<p>${DATA.tokyo.credits}</p><p>${DATA.osaka.credits}</p>`}
function renderAll(){renderHero();renderInterests();renderCards();renderPlan();renderCredits()}
function registerWebMCP(){const ctx=document.modelContext;if(!ctx?.registerTool)return;try{ctx.registerTool({name:"configure_japan_solo_trip",title:"设置日本独旅偏好",description:"设置东京或大阪基地、天数、节奏与兴趣，并更新页面上的候选目的地。",inputSchema:{type:"object",properties:{base:{type:"string",enum:["tokyo","osaka"]},days:{type:"integer",minimum:4,maximum:8},pace:{type:"string",enum:["easy","explore"]},interests:{type:"array",items:{type:"string",enum:Object.keys(INTERESTS)}}},required:["base","days","pace","interests"],additionalProperties:false},annotations:{readOnlyHint:false,untrustedContentHint:false},execute(input){if(!DATA[input.base]||!Number.isInteger(input.days)||input.days<4||input.days>8||!['easy','explore'].includes(input.pace)||!Array.isArray(input.interests)||input.interests.some(x=>!INTERESTS[x]))throw new Error('偏好参数无效');state.base=input.base;state.days=input.days;state.pace=input.pace;state.interests=new Set(input.interests);$("#days").value=state.days;$("#pace").value=state.pace;setPressed($("#base-control"),'button',state.base,'base');resetPlan();renderAll();return {base:state.base,days:state.days,result_count:filtered().length}}});ctx.registerTool({name:"generate_visible_itinerary",title:"生成当前独旅行程",description:"按页面当前偏好把候选地点安排进可见行程。",inputSchema:{type:"object",properties:{},additionalProperties:false},annotations:{readOnlyHint:false,untrustedContentHint:false},execute(){generatePlan();return {city:activeData().city,days:state.days,stops:state.plan.filter(findPlace).map(id=>findPlace(id).name)}}})}catch(e){console.warn('WebMCP unavailable',e)}}
$("#month").onchange=e=>{state.month=Number(e.target.value);renderCards();renderPlan()};
$("#base-control").onclick=e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button[data-base]');if(b)switchBase(b.dataset.base)};$("#days").onchange=e=>{state.days=Number(e.target.value);resetPlan()};$("#pace").onchange=e=>{state.pace=e.target.value;renderCards()};$("#scope").onclick=e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button[data-scope]');if(!b)return;state.scope=b.dataset.scope;setPressed($("#scope"),'button',state.scope,'scope');renderCards()};$("#hide-visited").onchange=renderCards;$("#generate").onclick=generatePlan;$("#save").onclick=save;$("#load").onclick=load;$("#export").onclick=exportText;$("#about").onclick=()=>$("#about-dialog").showModal();$("#credits").onclick=()=>$("#credits-dialog").showModal();$$('[data-close]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>$("#"+b.dataset.close).close());$$('dialog').forEach(d=>d.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===d)d.close()}));
resetPlan();renderAll();registerWebMCP();
